    "id": 589111,
    "title": "Breast Cancer Awareness ",
    "description": "<p>A Breast Cancer Event in October to promote awareness about breast cancer , highlighting the importance of early detection, and encouraging student donations to support the cause. It also aims to introduce students to WIE, activities, and opportunities for involvement.</p>\r\n<p>The event will feature a small pink-themed bake fair, educational booths in collaborations with other university clubs, interactive activities, small games, and awareness materials to engage students and promote the importance of breast cancer awareness.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
