   "id": "588430",
   "attributes": {
    "id": 588430,
    "title": "IEEE DAY 2026 – YARMOUK UNIVERSITY",
    "description": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">IEEE Day is a university-wide event organized by the IEEE Yarmouk University Student Branch, bringing together its affiliated Societies and the Women in Engineering (WIE) Affinity Group to celebrate IEEE&rsquo;s global community and promote engineering, technology, and innovation.</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The event will feature booths representing the different IEEE Societies and Affinity Group, providing students with opportunities to learn about their activities, explore technical interests, discover volunteering opportunities, and engage with the IEEE community.</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Through interactive booth activities and student engagement, IEEE Day aims to strengthen collaboration among IEEE teams, increase awareness of their initiatives, and encourage students to participate in future technical and professional development activities.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Venue:</strong> Hijjawi Faculty of Engineering Technology, Yarmouk University, Irbid, Jordan.</p>",
