    "title": "Opening and Launch Ceremony of the IEEE CIS at Yarmouk University",
    "description": "<p>Join us for the official inauguration ceremony of the IEEE Computational Intelligence Society (CIS) Student Branch Chapter at Yarmouk University. The event marks the official launch of the chapter, introducing our mission, executive committee, and upcoming roadmap of activities in Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and Data Science. The ceremony will feature welcome addresses from university representatives, faculty members, and IEEE Jordan Section officials.</p>",
