    "id": 587642,
    "title": "IEEE CS BAU Project Showcase & Membership Day (IEEE Day 2026 celebration)",
    "description": "<p>Join the IEEE Computer Society at Al-Balqa Applied University as we celebrate IEEE Day 2026!</p>\r\n<p>Visit our booth to:<br>- See live demos of student projects built by IEEE CS BAU members<br>- Learn what IEEE and the IEEE Computer Society offer students: workshops, competitions like IEEEXtreme, and professional growth<br>- Join IEEE / IEEE CS on the spot by scanning our QR code<br>- Enjoy games, Arabic coffee and sweets</p>\r\n<p>A technical session on stage will be announced soon.</p>\r\n<p>Open to all BAU students, faculty and staff, from every major.</p>\r\n<p>Date: Tuesday, November 10, 2026<br>Venue: Al-Balqa Applied University, Princess Janna bint Ghazi Theater<br>Organized by: IEEE Computer Society, BAU</p>\r\n<p>IEEE Day celebrates the first gathering of IEEE's founders in 1884, under the theme \"Leveraging Technology for a Better Tomorrow.\"</p>",
